  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Fondo Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Fund Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE IS TO SUPPORT THE GOE&apos;S POVERTY ALLEVIATION EFFORTS, PARTICULARLY THOSE DESIGNED TO REACH VULNERABLE GROUPS WITH SOCIAL SERVICES DURING A PERIOD OF ECONOMIC STABILIZATION AND REFORM OF PUBLIC SECTOR INSTITUTIONS. THE PROGRAM WILL INCLUDE AN INVESTMENT COMPONENT (TO FINANCE SMALL INFRASTRUCTURE SUB-PROJECTS) AND AN INSTITUTIONAL STREGTHENING COMPONENT.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
